  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&amp;youth Empowerment through skilling in Luuka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unemployment is one of the burning issue among women and youth. Due to lack of right skills, poor people are unable to utilize the available local resources. The poor people include the Luuka District communities in busoga sub-region of the country. forcible migrating to different places in Uganda  and working as a daily labors, construction workers, cooks, brick workers  and daily wages. The girls and women physically and sexually harassed by brick owners and contractors.</narrative>
  </description>
